Z||000000||87 Steve GT||01-15-2000||07:21 PM||||Ive got a 87 gt auto...  is there anyway to set the timing without a timing light??  =(||||reg||8
Z||000001||862M4inCA||01-15-2000||07:31 PM||||Chances are, if you don't have a timing light and you are good enough to "time it by ear" then you might be able to get it close enough to run worth a damn, otherwise if you need it set exactly to the specs, you might just have to bite the bullet and buy one at your local parts warehouse unless you know someone you can borrow one from.||||reg||1
Z||000002||batboy||01-15-2000||08:14 PM||||You'll never be able to "time it by ear" good enough to make the ECM happy. Beg, borrow, or buy a timing light.||||reg||1
Z||000003||dogtired||01-15-2000||09:44 PM||||Short Answer,     NO!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Long answer, well MAYBE???<BR>If the car will start and run now you can, loosen the distributor hold down bolt and nudge it around and then drive it?? The only tool then to see how you did is your seat of the pants meter??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>I wouldn't do this often, you can cause detonation, and valve problems.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR>To be on the safe side, ask around, Ill bet one of your relatives, friends, co-workers, school friends, teachers has one you can borrow??? They are not very expensieve?? Good Luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000004||VAROOM||01-15-2000||10:25 PM||||If every thing is where it should be there is a way. Take off the hold down clamp. there should be a stake mark from the factory setting, they use a cold chisel and put a mark on the base, and the intake manifold. That shoul get you running. I know with mine,  it ran, but due to other factors my timing is arround 14 instead of ten.  Good luck.||||reg||1
Z||000005||87 Steve GT||01-16-2000||02:08 AM||||GGGGGRRRREEAATTTTTT.....   Ok ... Thank you all...   and I guess I'll look for the factory mark...Varoom... or I just have to buy a timinglight... ||||reg||3
